#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:4
msgid "Controlling files in the distribution"
msgstr "控制散佈包中的檔案"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:6
msgid ""
"For the most common use cases, ``setuptools`` will automatically find out "
"which files are necessary for distributing the package. More precisely, the "
"following files are included in a source distribution by default:"
msgstr ""
"在最常見的使用案例中，``setuptools`` 會自動找出發布套件所需的檔案。更精確地"
"說，來源碼散佈包預設包含以下檔案："

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:10
msgid ""
":term:`pure Python module <Pure Module>` files implied by the ``py-modules`` "
"and ``packages`` configuration parameters in ``pyproject.toml`` and/or "
"equivalent in ``setup.cfg``/``setup.py``;"
msgstr ""
"由 ``pyproject.toml`` 中的 ``py-modules`` 和 ``packages`` 設定參數，及/或 "
"``setup.cfg``/``setup.py`` 中對應參數所隱含的\\ :term:`純 Python 模組 <Pure "
"Module>`\\ 檔案；"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:13
msgid ""
"C source files mentioned in the ``ext_modules`` or ``libraries`` ``setup()`` "
"arguments;"
msgstr ""
"在 ``setup()`` 的 ``ext_modules`` 或 ``libraries`` 引數中提到的 C 來源碼檔"
"案；"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:15
msgid ""
"Files that match the following glob patterns: ``tests/test*.py``, ``test/"
"test*.py``;"
msgstr "符合下列 glob 模式的檔案：``tests/test*.py``、``test/test*.py``；"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:17
msgid ""
"Scripts specified by the ``scripts-files`` configuration parameter in "
"``pyproject.toml`` or ``scripts`` in ``setup.py``/``setup.cfg``;"
msgstr ""
"由 ``pyproject.toml`` 中的 ``scripts-files`` 設定參數或 ``setup.py``/``setup."
"cfg`` 中的 ``scripts`` 指定的腳本；"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:19
msgid ""
"All files specified by the ``package-data`` and ``data-files`` configuration "
"parameters in ``pyproject.toml`` and/or equivalent in ``setup.cfg``/``setup."
