msgstr ""
"由 ``pyproject.toml`` 中的 ``package-data`` 和 ``data-files`` 設定參數，及/"
"或 ``setup.cfg``/``setup.py`` 中對應參數所指定的所有檔案；"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:22
msgid "The file specified by the ``license_file`` option in ``setup.cfg``;"
msgstr "由 ``setup.cfg`` 中 ``license_file`` 選項指定的檔案；"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:23
msgid ""
"All files specified by the ``license-files`` configuration parameter in "
"``pyproject.toml`` and/or equivalent in ``setup.cfg``/``setup.py``; note "
"that if you don't explicitly set this parameter, ``setuptools`` will include "
"any files that match the following glob patterns: ``LICEN[CS]E*``, "
"``COPYING*``, ``NOTICE*``, ``AUTHORS**``;"
msgstr ""
"由 ``pyproject.toml`` 中的 ``license-files`` 設定參數，及/或 ``setup.cfg``/"
"``setup.py`` 中對應參數所指定的所有檔案；請注意，如果你未明確設定此參數，"
"``setuptools`` 將包含任何符合下列 glob 模式的檔案：``LICEN[CS]E*``、"
"``COPYING*``、``NOTICE*``、``AUTHORS**``；"

