msgstr "``README``、``README.txt``、``README.rst`` 或 ``README.md``；"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:32
msgid "``MANIFEST.in``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:34
msgid ""
"Please note that the list above is guaranteed to work with the last stable "
"version of ``setuptools``. The behavior of older versions might differ."
msgstr ""
"請注意，上述清單保證在最新穩定版的 ``setuptools`` 中運作。較舊版本的行為可能"
"有所不同。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:38
msgid ""
"``setuptools`` will attempt to include type information files   by default "
"in the distribution   (``.pyi`` and ``py.typed``, as specified in :pep:"
"`561`),   as long as they are contained inside of a package directory   (for "
"the time being there is no automatic support for top-level ``.pyi`` files)."
msgstr ""
"``setuptools`` 預設會嘗試在散佈包中包含型別資訊檔案（``.pyi`` 和 ``py."
"typed``，如 :pep:`561` 所述），只要這些檔案位於套件目錄內即可（目前還不支援自"
"動處理頂層的 ``.pyi`` 檔案）。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:45
msgid ""
"*Please note however that this feature is* **EXPERIMENTAL** *and may change "
"in the future.*"
msgstr "*但請注意，此功能為*\\ **實驗性功能**\\ *，未來可能有所變更。*"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:48
msgid ""
"If you have ``.pyi`` and ``py.typed`` files in your project, but do not wish "
"to distribute them, you can opt out by setting :doc:`exclude-package-data </"
"userguide/datafiles>` to remove them."
msgstr ""
"如果你的專案中有 ``.pyi`` 和 ``py.typed`` 檔案，但不希望發布它們，你可以透過"
"設定 :doc:`exclude-package-data </userguide/datafiles>` 來排除。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:52
msgid ""
"However, when building more complex packages (e.g. packages that include non-"
"Python files, or that need to use custom C headers), you might find that not "
"all files present in your project folder are included in package :term:"
"`distribution archive <Distribution Package>`."
msgstr ""
"然而，在建置較複雜的套件時（例如包含非 Python 檔案的套件，或需要使用自訂 C 標"
"頭檔的套件），你可能會發現專案資料夾中的檔案並非全部都會包含在套件的 :term:`"
"發行封存檔 <Distribution Package>` 中。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:57
msgid ""
"If you are using a :wiki:`Revision Control System`, such as git_ or "
"mercurial_, and your source distributions only need to include files that "
"you're tracking in revision control, you can use a ``setuptools`` :ref:"
"`plugin <Adding Support for Revision Control Systems>`, such as :pypi:"
"`setuptools-scm` or :pypi:`setuptools-svn` to automatically include all "
"tracked files into the ``sdist``."
msgstr ""
"如果你使用的是 :wiki:`版本控制系統 <Revision Control System>`，例如 git_ 或 "
"mercurial_，且你的來源碼散佈包只需要包含你在版本控制中追蹤的檔案，你可以使用 "
"``setuptools`` 的 :ref:`外掛程式 <Adding Support for Revision Control "
"Systems>`，例如 :pypi:`setuptools-scm` 或 :pypi:`setuptools-svn`，來自動將所"
"有受追蹤的檔案納入 ``sdist``。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:65
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you need finer control over the files (e.g. you don't want "
"to distribute :wiki:`CI/CD`-related files) or you need automatically "
"generated files, you can add a ``MANIFEST.in`` file at the root of your "
"project, to specify any files that the default file location algorithm "
"doesn't catch."
msgstr ""
"或者，如果你需要對檔案進行更精細的控制（例如你不想發布與 :wiki:`CI/CD` 相關的"
"檔案），或者你需要自動產生的檔案，你可以在專案根目錄中加入 ``MANIFEST.in`` 檔"
"案，來指定預設檔案定位演算法未捕捉到的任何檔案。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:70
msgid ""
"This file contains instructions that tell ``setuptools`` which files exactly "
"should be part of the ``sdist`` (or not)."
msgstr ""
"此檔案包含指示，告訴 ``setuptools`` 哪些檔案應該（或不應該）是 ``sdist`` 的一"
"部分。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:74
msgid ""
"Please note that ``setuptools`` supports the ``MANIFEST.in``, and not "
"``MANIFEST`` (no extension). Any documentation, tutorial or example that "
"recommends using ``MANIFEST`` (no extension) is likely outdated."
msgstr ""
"請注意，``setuptools`` 支援的是 ``MANIFEST.in``，而不是 ``MANIFEST``（無副檔"
"名）。任何建議使用 ``MANIFEST``（無副檔名）的文件、教學或範例很可能都已過時。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:79
msgid ""
"The ``MANIFEST.in`` file contains commands that allow you to discover and "
"manipulate lists of files. There are many commands that can be used with "
"different objectives, but you should try to not make your ``MANIFEST.in`` "
"file too fine grained."
msgstr ""
"``MANIFEST.in`` 檔案包含允許你探索和操作檔案清單的指令。有許多指令可用於不同"
"的目的，但你應盡量不要讓 ``MANIFEST.in`` 檔案過於細碎。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:84
msgid ""
"A good idea is to start with a ``graft`` command (to add all files inside a "
"set of directories) and then fine tune the file selection by removing the "
"excess or adding isolated files."
msgstr ""
"一個好做法是從 ``graft`` 指令開始（加入一組目錄內的所有檔案），然後透過移除多"
"餘的檔案或加入個別檔案來微調檔案選取。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:89
msgid ""
"A :file:`MANIFEST.in` file consists of commands, one per line, instructing "
"setuptools to add or remove some set of files from the sdist.  The commands "
"are:"
msgstr ""
":file:`MANIFEST.in` 檔案由指令組成，每行一個指令，指示 setuptools 從 sdist 中"
"加入或移除某些檔案。這些指令如下："

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:94
msgid "Command"
msgstr "指令"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:94
msgid "Description"
msgstr "說明"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:96
msgid ":samp:`include {pat1} {pat2} ...`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:96
msgid ""
"Add all files matching any of the listed patterns (Files must be given as "
"paths relative to the root of the project)"
msgstr ""
"加入符合任何列出之模式的所有檔案（必須以相對於專案根目錄的路徑指定檔案）"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:98
msgid ":samp:`exclude {pat1} {pat2} ...`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:98
msgid ""
"Remove all files matching any of the listed patterns (Files must be given as "
"paths relative to the root of the project)"
msgstr ""
"移除符合任何列出之模式的所有檔案（必須以相對於專案根目錄的路徑指定檔案）"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:100
msgid ":samp:`recursive-include {dir-pattern} {pat1} {pat2} ...`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:100
msgid ""
"Add all files under directories matching ``dir-pattern`` that match any of "
"the listed patterns"
msgstr "加入符合 ``dir-pattern`` 的目錄下、且符合任何列出之模式的所有檔案"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:101
msgid ":samp:`recursive-exclude {dir-pattern} {pat1} {pat2} ...`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:101
msgid ""
"Remove all files under directories matching ``dir-pattern`` that match any "
"of the listed patterns"
msgstr "移除符合 ``dir-pattern`` 的目錄下、且符合任何列出之模式的所有檔案"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:102
msgid ":samp:`global-include {pat1} {pat2} ...`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:102
msgid ""
"Add all files anywhere in the source tree matching any of the listed patterns"
msgstr "加入來源碼樹中任何位置符合任何列出之模式的所有檔案"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:103
msgid ":samp:`global-exclude {pat1} {pat2} ...`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:103
msgid ""
"Remove all files anywhere in the source tree matching any of the listed "
"patterns"
msgstr "移除來源碼樹中任何位置符合任何列出之模式的所有檔案"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:104
msgid ":samp:`graft {dir-pattern}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:104
msgid "Add all files under directories matching ``dir-pattern``"
msgstr "加入符合 ``dir-pattern`` 的目錄下的所有檔案"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:105
msgid ":samp:`prune {dir-pattern}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:105
msgid "Remove all files under directories matching ``dir-pattern``"
msgstr "移除符合 ``dir-pattern`` 的目錄下的所有檔案"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:108
msgid ""
"The patterns here are glob-style patterns: ``*`` matches zero or more "
"regular filename characters (on Unix, everything except forward slash; on "
"Windows, everything except backslash and colon); ``?`` matches a single "
"regular filename character, and ``[chars]`` matches any one of the "
"characters between the square brackets (which may contain character ranges, "
"e.g., ``[a-z]`` or ``[a-fA-F0-9]``).  Setuptools also has support for ``**`` "
"matching zero or more characters including forward slash, backslash, and "
"colon."
msgstr ""
"這裡的模式是 glob 樣式模式：``*`` 符合零個或多個一般檔名字元（在 Unix 上，除"
"正斜線外的所有字元；在 Windows 上，除反斜線和冒號外的所有字元）；``?`` 符合單"
"個一般檔名字元；而 ``[chars]`` 符合方括號內的任何一個字元（可包含字元範圍，例"
"如 ``[a-z]`` 或 ``[a-fA-F0-9]``）。Setuptools 也支援 ``**``，可符合包含正斜"
"線、反斜線和冒號在內的零個或多個字元。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:116
msgid ""
"Directory patterns are relative to the root of the project directory; e.g., "
"``graft example*`` will include a directory named :file:`examples` in the "
"project root but will not include :file:`docs/examples/`."
msgstr ""
"目錄模式是相對於專案目錄的根目錄；例如，``graft example*`` 會包含專案根目錄中"
"名為 :file:`examples` 的目錄，但不會包含 :file:`docs/examples/`。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:120
msgid ""
"File & directory names in :file:`MANIFEST.in` should be ``/``-separated; "
"setuptools will automatically convert the slashes to the local platform's "
"appropriate directory separator."
msgstr ""
":file:`MANIFEST.in` 中的檔案和目錄名稱應以 ``/`` 分隔；setuptools 會自動將斜"
"線轉換為當地平台適用的目錄分隔符號。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:124
msgid ""
"Commands are processed in the order they appear in the :file:`MANIFEST.in` "
"file.  For example, given the commands:"
msgstr ""
"指令會按照它們在 :file:`MANIFEST.in` 檔案中出現的順序處理。例如，給定以下指"
"令："

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:127
msgid ""
"graft tests\n"
"global-exclude *.py[cod]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:132
msgid ""
"the contents of the directory tree :file:`tests` will first be added to the "
"sdist, and then after that all files in the sdist with a ``.pyc``, ``.pyo``, "
"or ``.pyd`` extension will be removed from the sdist.  If the commands were "
"in the opposite order, then ``*.pyc`` files etc. would be only be removed "
"from what was already in the sdist before adding :file:`tests`, and if :file:"
"`tests` happened to contain any ``*.pyc`` files, they would end up included "
"in the sdist because the exclusion happened before they were included."
msgstr ""
"目錄樹 :file:`tests` 的內容會先被加入 sdist，然後 sdist 中所有副檔名為 ``."
"pyc``、``.pyo`` 或 ``.pyd`` 的檔案會從 sdist 中移除。如果指令順序相反，則 "
"``*.pyc`` 等檔案只會從加入 :file:`tests` 之前的 sdist 中移除；如果 :file:"
"`tests` 恰好包含任何 ``*.pyc`` 檔案，它們最終會包含在 sdist 中，因為排除是在"
"它們被加入之前發生的。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:140
msgid ""
"An example of ``MANIFEST.in`` for a simple project that organized according "
"to a :ref:`src-layout` is:"
msgstr "以下是按照 :ref:`src-layout` 組織的簡單專案之 ``MANIFEST.in`` 範例："

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:143
msgid ""
"# MANIFEST.in -- just for illustration\n"
"graft src\n"
"graft tests\n"
"graft docs\n"
"# `-> adds all files inside a directory\n"
"\n"
"include tox.ini\n"
"# `-> matches file paths relative to the root of the project\n"
"\n"
"global-exclude *~ *.py[cod] *.so\n"
"# `-> matches file names (regardless of directory)"
msgstr ""
"# MANIFEST.in -- 僅供說明\n"
"graft src\n"
"graft tests\n"
"graft docs\n"
"# `-> 加入目錄內的所有檔案\n"
"\n"
"include tox.ini\n"
"# `-> 比對相對於專案根目錄的檔案路徑\n"
"\n"
"global-exclude *~ *.py[cod] *.so\n"
"# `-> 比對檔案名稱（無論目錄為何）"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:157
msgid ""
"Once the correct files are present in the ``sdist``, they can then be used "
"by binary extensions during the build process, or included in the final :"
"term:`wheel <Wheel>` [#build-process]_ if you configure ``setuptools`` with "
"``include_package_data=True``."
msgstr ""
"一旦正確的檔案存在於 ``sdist`` 中，它們就可以在建置過程中被二進位擴充功能使"
"用，或者如果你將 ``setuptools`` 設定為 ``include_package_data=True``，則會包"
"含在最終的 :term:`wheel <Wheel>` [#build-process]_ 中。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:163
msgid ""
"Please note that, when using ``include_package_data=True``, only files "
"**inside the package directory** are included in the final ``wheel``, by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"請注意，使用 ``include_package_data=True`` 時，預設情況下最終的 ``wheel`` 中"
"只會包含\\ **軟體包目錄內**\\ 的檔案。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:166
msgid ""
"So for example, if you create a :term:`Python project <Project>` that uses :"
"pypi:`setuptools-scm` and have a ``tests`` directory outside of the package "
"folder, the ``tests`` directory will be present in the ``sdist`` but not in "
"the ``wheel`` [#wheel-vs-sdist]_."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果你建立一個使用 :pypi:`setuptools-scm` 的 :term:`Python 專案 "
"<Project>`，且在套件資料夾外有一個 ``tests`` 目錄，那麼 ``tests`` 目錄會存在"
"於 ``sdist`` 中，但不會存在於 ``wheel`` [#wheel-vs-sdist]_ 中。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:171
msgid "See :doc:`/userguide/datafiles` for more information."
msgstr "更多資訊請參閱 :doc:`/userguide/datafiles`。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:177
msgid "Caching and Troubleshooting"
msgstr "快取與疑難排解"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:179
msgid ""
"Setuptools automatically creates a few directories to host build artefacts "
"and cache files, such as ``build``, ``dist``, ``*.egg-info``.  While cache "
"is useful to speed up incremental builds, in some edge cases it might become "
"stale.  If you feel that caching is causing problems to your build, "
"specially after changes in configuration or in the directory/file "
"structure., consider removing ``build``, ``dist``, ``*.egg-info`` [#PKG-"
"INFO]_ before rebuilding or reinstalling your project."
msgstr ""
"Setuptools 會自動建立一些目錄來存放建置產物和快取檔案，例如 ``build``、"
"``dist``、``*.egg-info``。雖然快取有助於加速增量建置，但在某些邊緣情況下可能"
"會變得過時。如果你覺得快取導致建置出現問題，特別是在變更設定或目錄/檔案結構"
"後，請考慮在重新建置或重新安裝專案之前移除 ``build``、``dist``、``*.egg-"
"info`` [#PKG-INFO]_。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:190
msgid ""
"You can think about the build process as two stages: first the ``sdist`` "
"will be created and then the ``wheel`` will be produced from that ``sdist``."
msgstr ""
"你可以將建置過程視為兩個階段：首先會建立 ``sdist``，然後從該 ``sdist`` 產生 "
"``wheel``。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:194
msgid ""
"This happens because the ``sdist`` can contain files that are useful during "
"development or the build process itself, but not in runtime (e.g. tests, "
"docs, examples, etc...). The ``wheel``, on the other hand, is a file format "
"that has been optimized and is ready to be unpacked into a running "
"installation of Python or :term:`Virtual Environment`. Therefore it only "
"contains items that are required during runtime."
msgstr ""
"這是因為 ``sdist`` 可以包含在開發或建置過程中有用、但在執行時期不需要的檔案"
"（例如測試、文件、範例等）。另一方面，``wheel`` 是一種已經過最佳化的檔案格"
"式，準備好解壓縮到正在執行中的 Python 安裝或 :term:`虛擬環境 <Virtual "
"Environment>` 中。因此它只包含執行時期所需的項目。"

#: ../../../userguide/miscellaneous.rst:203
msgid ""
"When working from an extracted sdist (e.g. for patching), you might also "
"consider removing the ``PKG-INFO`` file to force its recreation."
msgstr ""
"當從解壓縮的 sdist 工作時（例如進行修補），你也可以考慮移除 ``PKG-INFO`` 檔案"
"以強制重新建立。"
